+# Monclo Apparel
+
+A silver-grey streetwear storefront for shirts and apparel. Browser interactions are written in **PyScript (Python in the browser)** and served by Flask.
+
+## Quick start
+
+```bash
+python -m venv .venv
+# macOS/Linux: source .venv/bin/activate
+# Windows PowerShell: .venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
+pip install -r requirements.txt
+python server.py
+```
+
+Open http://127.0.0.1:5000/. **Internet access is required to load the PyScript runtime, Google Fonts, and example Unsplash photography.** The site is not a static-only HTML file: run the Flask app.
+
+The finished project has six separately reviewable Git commits. See `COMMITS.md` for the complete sequence and deployment cautions.
